PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent (#00000000)
Stroke: 4px, High-Contrast Black (#000000FF)
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px, White (#FFFFFFFF)
Grid: 100px major, 20px minor, 20% opacity

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
    - 2D plane grid, centered
  L1: Primary Geometry
    - Smooth curved surface (manifold patch), 6px stroke
  L2: Tangent Spaces
    - Two tangent planes at p and q
    - Each plane: light-gray fill (#FFFFFF22), 4px border
  L3: Vectors
    - Basis vectors e1, e2 drawn on each tangent plane
  L4: Labels
    - "M" on manifold
    - "T_pM" and "T_qM" on tangent planes
    - Points p and q marked with filled circles (#FFFFFFFF)
  L5: Annotation Overlay
    - Arrow from p to tangent plane labeled "tangent space"
    - Same for q

Export:
  PNG (RGBA), sRGB, no compression artifacts
